title: 'statement-store: enforce allowance against best and finalized blocks'
doc:
- audience:
  - Node Dev
  - Node Operator
  description: |-
    Allowance enforcement now checks each account against the larger of its best-block and
    finalized-block allowances. Submission checks only the best block, so enforcing the finalized
    allowance alone evicted, and banned for up to 48h, statements accepted after an allowance
    increase that was not finalized yet.
crates:
- name: sc-statement-store
  bump: patch
